WEBVTT

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:34.890
Cities are places of economic
dynamism and innovation.

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:40.455
But we need to make urban life
more pleasant, agile,

00:04:40.479 --> 00:04:42.719
healthy and flexible.

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:47.386
To do so, we need to make sure everyone --

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:49.486
and I mean everyone,

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:53.776
those living downtown
and those living at the fringes --

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:59.596
has access to all key services
within proximity.

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:01.400
How do we get this done?